<!DOCTYPE html>
<!--
  index.html of the Forms client bundle – the page users open at
  @@BASE_URL@@ (Nginx shows it instead of a 403 for the directory).
  Rendered by 09-Install/40-oracle_forms_client_bundle.sh from
  09-Install/client_templates/index.html.template – edit the template, not the
  rendered file. Placeholders: @@APP_NAME@@ @@BASE_URL@@ @@JAVA_VERSION@@
  @@FSAL_VERSION@@ @@SETUP_VERSION@@ @@GENERATED@@
  Self-contained: no external fonts, scripts or images (works offline in the
  intranet, nothing is loaded from the internet).
-->
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>@@APP_NAME@@ – Installation</title>
<style>
  :root { --fg:#1f2933; --muted:#52606d; --bg:#f5f7fa; --card:#ffffff; --accent:#c74634; --line:#d9e2ec; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin:0; font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif; color:var(--fg); background:var(--bg); line-height:1.5; }
  main { max-width: 720px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 16px; }
  .card { background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:8px; padding:28px 32px; }
  h1 { margin:0 0 4px; font-size:1.6em; }
  .sub { color:var(--muted); margin:0 0 24px; }
  a.button { display:inline-block; background:var(--accent); color:#fff; text-decoration:none;
             padding:12px 22px; border-radius:6px; font-weight:600; }
  a.button:hover { filter: brightness(0.92); }
  ol { padding-left: 1.3em; }
  li { margin: 6px 0; }
  .note { border-left:4px solid var(--line); padding:8px 14px; color:var(--muted); margin:22px 0 0; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 22px; font-size: 0.9em; color: var(--muted); }
  td { padding: 2px 16px 2px 0; }
  code { background:#eef2f6; padding:1px 4px; border-radius:3px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>@@APP_NAME@@</h1>
    <p class="sub">Installation des Oracle Forms Clients für Windows (ohne Administratorrechte)<br>
       <span lang="en">Oracle Forms client for Windows – installation without administrator rights</span></p>

    <p><a class="button" href="FormsWeb-Install.cmd" download>Installieren / Install</a></p>

    <ol>
      <li><b>FormsWeb-Install.cmd</b> herunterladen und mit Doppelklick starten.<br>
          <span lang="en">Download FormsWeb-Install.cmd and double-click it.</span></li>
      <li>Das Programm lädt Java und den Forms Client von diesem Server und legt eine
          Verknüpfung <b>@@APP_NAME@@</b> auf dem Desktop an.<br>
          <span lang="en">It downloads Java and the Forms client from this server and creates a desktop shortcut.</span></li>
      <li>Danach immer über die Verknüpfung starten – Updates werden beim Start automatisch geladen.<br>
          <span lang="en">Always start from the shortcut – updates are installed automatically at start.</span></li>
    </ol>

    <p class="note">Warnt Windows (SmartScreen) beim Start der Datei, mit
       „Weitere Informationen“ → „Trotzdem ausführen“ bestätigen – oder die
       IT-Abteilung fragen. Bei Problemen: Protokolle unter
       <code>%LOCALAPPDATA%\FormsWeb\logs</code>.</p>

    <table>
      <tr><td>Java</td><td>@@JAVA_VERSION@@</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Forms Client (FSAL)</td><td>@@FSAL_VERSION@@</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Setup</td><td>@@SETUP_VERSION@@</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Stand / built</td><td>@@GENERATED@@</td></tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</main>
</body>
</html>
